x_comment(x_UnitedKingdomOfGreatBritainAndNorthernIreland,"The United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland, (often referred to as \"the United Kingdom\", or \"The UK\"), an #$IndependentCountry off the northwest coast of Europe consisting of #$England, #$Scotland, #$Wales, and #$NorthernIreland.  It technically excludes the #$IsleOfMan-Island and the #$ChannelIslands, which are realms of the British monarch. As with all instances of #$IndependentCountry, this is the UK as a country qua political and historical entity (and also qua geographical entity in \"dualist\" microtheories).") :- x_cid(a65b1280b0aa4f).
